  "description": "The Nuroad C:62 Pro combines the comfort, low weight and pace of a full carbon gravel chassis with Shimano's gravel-specific GRX 2x12 groupset, giving you everything you need to ride further afield with a huge range of closely spaced gears. The Newmen Advanced G.34 SJ carbon wheelset is the ideal home for a pair of super-grippy Schwalbe 45mm G-One R Pro tyres, with space for up to 50mm if needed. Add the power of Shimano GRX hydraulic disc brakes and the comfort of a full carbon fork, and it's everything you need to show the dirt roads exactly who's boss.",
